.TH trimsec 1  "trimsec 4.3.3" 
.SH NAME
trimsec
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtrimsec\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
trimsec\-path(1)
Shows the path of the configuration file
.TP
trimsec\-list(1)
Lists all entries in a YouTube playlist
.TP
trimsec\-key(1)
Command group for managing the Google Cloud Console API key
.TP
trimsec\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v4.3.3
